Inheritance-
    -Instead of rewriting the same code in multiple places we allow child class
        to reuse the parent properties and methods.

   # Types of Inheritance-
            1.Single Inheritance
                -single parent, single child.
            2.Multiple Inheritance
                -multiple parents, single child.
            3.Hierarchical Inheritance
                -single parent, multiple childs.
            4.Multilevel Inheritance
                -single parent, single child, single grand-child.

       @ Advantages-
            -reusability
            -polymoriphism
            -Scalability
            -Maintainability












    # Other Names:
        -'parent class' is also called as "Base class".
        -'Child class' is also called as "Derived class".
